{"src":"en","tgt":"de","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"de","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":15139.958330999998,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":15624.121373999998,"text":"1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensande in die Liste der gefährdeten Welterbestätten aufgenommen."},{"kind":"audio","t":16333.328904999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16335.169975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16336.587268,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16337.517487999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16339.331027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16340.196609999999,"samples":16439,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":18902.389687,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19429.99221,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film National Treasure gesehen haben, glauben Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte geschrieben stand."},{"kind":"audio","t":20261.991514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":20263.242846999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20265.103497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20266.857576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20268.677996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20270.334949,"samples":29257,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"input","t":26880.712298,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27325.28957,"text":"Kinder kommen aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien, die von Vernachlässigung bis hin zu Missbrauch reichen."},{"kind":"audio","t":27937.140745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27938.560561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27940.263383999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27942.049982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27942.901534,"samples":18835,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":29874.300139,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":30066.527323,"text":"und sogar bis hin zu Erpressung."},{"kind":"audio","t":30242.457361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30242.739816,"samples":6798,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":40828.605029,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41510.997257,"text":"Das Chocamo-Tal, Chiles bedeutendstes Klettergebiet, bekannt als das Yosemite Südamerikas, mit einer Vielzahl an Granit-Big-Walls und Felsklettern."},{"kind":"audio","t":42367.593836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":42368.880483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42370.614923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42372.415793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42374.292317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42376.025785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":42376.496243,"samples":11535,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":46505.834039,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":46890.176006,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen wissenschaftlichen Fragen, einschließlich der Physiologie, wurden akzeptiert."},{"kind":"audio","t":47527.677128999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47529.290808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47531.022082999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47532.861261,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":47533.584249,"samples":16606,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":54324.415113,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54699.946532,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie wachsam. Steile Steigungen, schmale Gassen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen."},{"kind":"audio","t":55333.154845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55334.755704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55336.516754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55336.698768,"samples":6742,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"audio","t":55338.524866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55340.392897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55341.316287,"samples":20284,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":67520.10399900001,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":68226.197524,"text":"Die Präsenz des wahren unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109, ist ebenfalls eine einzigartige Komponente eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"audio","t":69300.70005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69301.66637400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69303.521466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69305.18372700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69307.03307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69308.788442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69310.656743,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69312.47772400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":69312.624144,"samples":2006,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":73008.463569,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":73414.75917300001,"text":"Nachdem der Unfall passiert war, wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus transportiert, verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"audio","t":74031.51598000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74032.97655800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":74034.85595600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74036.59562400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74037.290429,"samples":14934,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":82819.723677,"text":"Many German baked goods feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":83193.59680000001,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren enthalten Mandeln, Haselnüsse und andere Schalenfrüchte. Beliebte Kuchen passen oft besonders gut zu einer Tasse starkem Kaffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":83861.249788,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83862.84682100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83864.38945300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83864.771307,"samples":10643,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"audio","t":83866.838117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83868.777906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83870.09599,"samples":26972,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"input","t":90185.526868,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90729.670282,"text":"Es versteht sich von selbst, dass es für Sie einfacher sein wird, Portugiesisch zu lernen, wenn Sie eine romanische Sprache beherrschen."},{"kind":"audio","t":91460.39576500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91461.757194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91463.68560600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91465.793208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91467.48900900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91467.637122,"samples":5015,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":97872.202535,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98337.497363,"text":"Die Ton- und Lichtshow an den Pyramiden ist für Kinder eine der interessantesten Attraktionen in der Gegend."},{"kind":"audio","t":98917.328603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98918.80937100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98920.92014700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98922.56179800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98922.73797300001,"samples":7411,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":103770.42766100001,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":104093.124291,"text":"Der Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten."},{"kind":"audio","t":104615.16685600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104616.444269,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104618.14489800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104619.649092,"samples":28476,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"input","t":106583.327594,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106820.242475,"text":"und die Wechselwirkungen, die sie untereinander eingehen."},{"kind":"audio","t":107114.867612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":107117.000522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107117.1524,"samples":1894,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":114676.644174,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":115040.517028,"text":"Australiens Mitchell Gowrie belegte im Super-G der Männer den 11. Platz."},{"kind":"audio","t":115435.521471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115436.829219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115437.93930900001,"samples":26136,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":115438.540985,"samples":12260,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":121667.30279900001,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":122110.606795,"text":"Der Teilnehmer Ulrich Joklin belegte im Super-G der Männer in der Kategorie Sitzen den 16. Platz."},{"kind":"audio","t":122654.638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122656.072409,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122657.65868600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122659.41994600001,"samples":31820,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":122659.956774,"samples":12538,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":128673.37105300001,"text":"As referenced, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought the"},{"kind":"text","t":129137.07991500001,"text":"Wie erwähnt, legen unabhängige Studien nahe, dass ein nepalesisches UN-Friedenseinsatzbattalion unwissentlich das"},{"kind":"audio","t":129784.941961,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129786.321547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129788.06079400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129789.850347,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129791.15355800002,"samples":26080,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"input","t":136570.844919,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":136968.196514,"text":"Kurz nach Ausbruch der Feindseligkeiten leitete Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland ein."},{"kind":"audio","t":137524.058973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137526.129079,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137528.68185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137530.393446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137530.648359,"samples":7968,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":145699.49609200002,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":146041.882362,"text":"Es griff zudem alles an, was ins Wasser gelangte. Selbst ein riesiger Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex wäre ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"audio","t":146517.128937,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146518.471498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146518.63586500002,"samples":2451,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":146610.643533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146612.09614900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146613.860824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":146613.998411,"samples":891,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":155077.793727,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155446.7628,"text":"Der Einsatz von Videoaufzeichnungen hat zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen bei der Interpretation von Mikroexpressionen geführt."},{"kind":"audio","t":156081.133903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156082.990327,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156084.418276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156086.17892500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156086.97906,"samples":18000,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":159381.612279,"text":"facial movements which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":159669.34775800002,"text":"Gesichtsbewegungen, die nur wenige Millisekunden dauern."},{"kind":"audio","t":159975.967305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":159977.409445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159977.868836,"samples":13597,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167482.22643100002,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":167893.008997,"text":"Die Bekanntgabe erfolgte, nachdem Trump ein Telefonat mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan geführt hatte."},{"kind":"audio","t":168543.67491200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":168544.950912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168546.641867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168548.353202,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168549.680299,"samples":26080,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"input","t":174971.053945,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":175352.99536,"text":"Dies sind manchmal überfüllte Familienstrände mit einer guten Auswahl an Geschäften entlang der Küste."},{"kind":"audio","t":175886.611242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175887.939802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175889.613781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175891.191224,"samples":29870,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"input","t":177073.315595,"text":"I just want to get safe."},{"kind":"text","t":177245.71489,"text":"Ich will einfach nur in Sicherheit kommen."},{"kind":"audio","t":177443.765546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177444.04966400002,"samples":10699,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":188488.24517500002,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":188918.491071,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder mit Frankreich verbunden und als luxuriöse Strandresorts bekannt."},{"kind":"audio","t":189651.086868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189652.288035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189653.98045200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189655.834292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189657.603925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":189658.206011,"samples":13931,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":450},{"kind":"close","t":199703.874178,"code":1005}]}